- New suite: **47/47 pass** · `sw-loop-test.sh`: **68/68 pass** · version check: **consistent**
- Runtime e2e: loop ran with `--adaptive-model`, scored each iteration, logged `model-routing.jsonl`, no crash
- Default-safe: 2 gated call sites — byte-identical loop behavior when off
